  {
   "id": "decollate-decoration-266187@major-2026-04-28",
   "gameId": "decollate-decoration-266187",
   "displayName": "[Update] Korean Language Support & 10,000 Copies Sold!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-04-28T11:55:28.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Thank you very much for playing \"Decollate Decoration.\"",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\\[Celebration! Over 10,000 Copies Sold Worldwide!]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thanks to your incredible support, the total worldwide sales of this game have surpassed 10,000 copies!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We were able to reach this major milestone thanks to the \"love\" from fans all over the world.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\\[New Language Support: Korean]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We have received many requests for Korean language support, and it is finally here! With this update, you can now switch to the following languages in the game settings:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Japanese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "English",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Simplified Chinese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Traditional Chinese",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Korean (NEW!)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\\[Other Adjustments]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Adjusted the icons on pages 1 and 3 of the hint screen to be more intuitive and easier to understand.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "\\[Special Sale Now Live!]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If you haven't played the game yet, please take this opportunity to experience the story.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "\\[Regarding Steam Community Items]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "With the opening of the Point Shop in March, Steam Trading Cards can now be obtained based on your playtime.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Due to Steam's specifications, those who have already cleared the game will need to accumulate more playtime to receive them, but we hope you enjoy collecting them as a memento!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45194381/83f976cd034367c992ba678231552134caf9f145.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
